+## Batch follow-up, 2026-09-22 (source 44afd39e)
+
+Main-agent-only execution requested by the user; no builder handoff or subagent
+review. Both CDP pages were captured at 1440×900; Comment/Update, editor focus,
+Post hover and the health menu were inspected without submitting or selecting a
+health value. Local evidence: `/tmp/orv-composer-9222-*.json` and corresponding PNGs.
+
+Confirmed additional measurements:
+
+- Composer border 1px `lch(97.3 0 282)`, radius10, white, two subtle shadows
+  (0 3px 6px -2px at .02; 0 1px 1px at .04). A pseudo-element's stored blue shadow
+  alone does not prove it is painted; the focused screenshot has no black border.
+- Header padding12px 12px 0, gap8; tablist26px, tabs24px, zero list gap/padding.
+- Editor content15px/450/24px, content inset16px; editor region70px with12px
+  preceding space. Footer52px: 12px top/bottom, 12px left/14px right, 28px row.
+- Health icon16px; its On track label is `lch(60 64.37 141.95)`, not gray.
+- Post hover background `lch(95.886 0 282)`. Comment mode hides Health and Write
+  with Agent, changes placeholder, and its submit label is `Comment`.
+- Source locales already use `Comment`; the current Electron instance displayed
+  older `Post comment`. Investigate loaded locale/caching, do not duplicate keys.
+- At390px the reference Properties surface overlays the content; the candidate
+  instead unmounts the panel. This is a separate frame/interaction gap, not a pass.
+
+Implement these measured composer controls in one scoped batch. Preserve working
+mode/health/post behavior and empty-body validation; reference `disabled=false`
+does not establish successful empty posting. Keep existing dark tokens rather
+than applying unobserved light colors globally. Attachment, Agent, summary,
+health-icon geometry, dark states and full page-frame parity remain open.
